  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Manejo de Desechos Slidos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solid Waste Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO SUPPORT GOVERNMENT PROGRAMS TO IMPROVE SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT IN NEW PROVIDENCE AND SOME OF THE FAMILY ISLANDS. THE COMPONENTS ANTICIPATED INCLUDE THE INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING AND REGULATORY ADJUSTMENTS.; PRIORITY INVESTMENTS FOR DISPOSAL FACILITIES; PUBLIC AWARENESS CAMPAIGNS; THE ESTABLISHMENT OF PROGRAMS TO REDUCE, REUSE AND RECYCLE SOLID WASTE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
